✅ PASS: Predictability score reflects sequence learning: TL/BR alternation scores high, uniform transitions stay low
✅ PASS: Learns N-gram alternating pattern: TL -> BR -> TL -> BR
✅ PASS: Probabilities always sum to 1.0 and are non-negative
✅ PASS: Dive zone selection returns valid zone and respects probabilities
✅ PASS: Heatmap and accuracy calculation
✅ PASS: Export and import state preserves all data
✅ PASS: Tied probabilities: fair dive sampling and no fake prediction
✅ PASS: Draw match result and sanitization against invalid data
✅ PASS: Sequence predictability resilience: 15x alternating TL/BR + 1 TM retains high sequence predictability
✅ PASS: Predictability score requires >= 8 shots, returns null / 數據不足 otherwise
✅ PASS: Five distinct varied zones yields low predictability (< 30)

All 14 / 14 tests passed successfully!

