✅ PASS: Overpower swipe (power > 0.92) -> flies over the crossbar
✅ PASS: Zone classification accurately bins goal points into 6 zones

All 5 / 5 tests passed successfully!

--- Running Keeper AI (src/keeperAI.js) Unit Tests ---

